    "rawHtml": {
      "value": "<div style=\"height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;background:var(--cc-appBackground-surface)\"><div style=\"height:100%;padding:18px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:12px;background:#fff;color:#334155;box-sizing:border-box\"><div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a\">Required capability to complete execution</div><ol style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:20px;margin:10px 0 0 18px;padding:0\"><li>Expose an authenticated ToolJet internal API that lists app queries with query ID, name, kind, datasource ID, and non-secret options.</li><li>Expose execution of an existing query by query ID and return status, response, error, and duration.</li><li>Approve ToolJet DB access for the query catalog and append-only query execution history.</li></ol></div></div>"
